							.project-detail-item
								h3 The team
								ul.smaller-list-indent
									li
										a.button-tiny(
											target="_blank" 
											href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/elizabeth-liz-liao/"
											) Elizabeth Liao
									li
										a.button-tiny(
											target="_blank" 
											href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/irina-ng-035a4b251/"
											) Irina Ng
							.project-detail-item
								h3 What I did
								p
									| I designed the system of the main MSP form, conducted thematic analysis on user study data, and developed the prototype's interactions in ProtoPie.
				#toc.toc
					h2 In this piece
					ul
						li
							a(
								data-target="what_it_is" 
								href="#what_it_is"
								) What it is
						li
							a(
								data-target="qualitative_interviews" 
								href="#qualitative_interviews"
								)
